WEBVTT

00:01:29.132 --> 00:01:32.990
Šenzen nije postojao kao grad.

00:01:32.990 --> 00:01:36.269
Nije bilo automobila.

00:01:36.269 --> 00:01:38.920
Trideset godina kasnije,

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:41.915
ovo je Peking danas.

00:01:41.915 --> 00:01:43.628
Ovo je Hong Kong.

00:01:43.628 --> 00:01:46.128
Ako ste bogati, živite ondje,

00:01:46.128 --> 00:01:48.548
ako ste siromašni,živite ovdje,

00:01:48.548 --> 00:01:51.214
ali velika je gustoća, 
i nije tako samo u Aziji.

00:01:51.214 --> 00:01:53.171
Sao Paulo, možete putovati

00:01:53.171 --> 00:01:55.695
u helikopteru 45 minuta

00:01:55.695 --> 00:01:57.705
i vidjeti kako neboderi konzumiraju

00:01:57.705 --> 00:02:00.341
niski okoliš 19. stoljeća.